msgid "SERIAL1 -> UART1 (Telem1) DMA-enabled"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> UART1（Telem1），DMA 已启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:136
#: 61bedb2a0e784846a053c90eb129bbd6
msgid ""
"SERIAL2 -> not available externally, internally connected to currently "
"unsupported BT-LE module"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> 外部不可用，内部连接到当前不受支持的 BT-LE 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:137
#: 1dc53e4f77d248b3b2e4a9b416fee0a7
msgid "SERIAL3 -> UART3 (SmartAudio VTX protocol by default)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> UART3（默认使用 SmartAudio VTX 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:138
#: b8706646276444fc95357d4b9cf25526
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (GPS) DMA-enabled"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（GPS），DMA 已启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:139
#: bdfa085c444a4b58ae2af443b68ec778
msgid "SERIAL5 -> not available"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> 不可用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:140
#: 3aad891d5fc04387a14640ff270e1497
msgid ""
"SERIAL6 -> UART6 (Setup for serial RX Protocol SBUS by default) DMA-enabled"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（默认配置为 SBUS 串口 RC 协议），DMA 已启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:141
#: 0065f384011d4bf0b72aec23a460bd0f
msgid ""
"SERIAL7 -> UART7 (RX7 only available, normally used for ESC telemetry "
"protocol by default)"
msgstr "SERIAL7 -> UART7（仅 RX7 可用，默认通常用于 ESC 数传协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:143
#: 7b7a1277672b4097b3432655e08a8d54
msgid ""
"The SERIAL7 port (UART7) is normally for ESC telemetry, and has an R7 pin on"
" both of the ESC connectors."
msgstr "SERIAL7 端口（UART7）通常用于 ESC 数传，两个 ESC 连接器上均有 R7 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:146
#: 20b5ebd3393e4ea1bdbe70112409736c
msgid "Any UART may be re-tasked by changing its protocol parameter."
msgstr "任何 UART 均可通过更改其协议参数重新分配用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:149
#: 01f1ed9dd0084a068382064db6e9b986
msgid "Copter Default Frame Type"
msgstr "Copter 默认机架类型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:151
#: cc8d7850229246a5a277bb0ff2a9e12b
msgid ""
"For Copter firmware the FRAME_TYPE is already defaulted to type \"12\" "
"(BetaFlight X) allowing existing BetaFlight configurations with ESCs "
"attached to have the correct motor ordering without changes to the "
"FRAME_TYPE and FRAME_CLASS parameters or ESC wiring."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 固件，FRAME_TYPE 已默认设置为 「12」（BetaFlight X），使得使用现有 BetaFlight 配置连接 ESC"
" 的用户无需更改 FRAME_TYPE 和 FRAME_CLASS 参数或 ESC 接线即可获得正确的电机顺序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:154
#: 81e5bb13550a41279458eb9dbc94f4dc
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:156
#: 02685691caf640b694fb5dcbac176c50
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R6 (UART6_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R6（UART6_RX）引脚上。支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-systems` "
"了解特定 RC 系统详情。:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」 以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:158
#: 1b74b04221eb447cafb26db4f4b6f4af
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:160
#: eae08594cf01451090c87c7cc92fd9bb
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 T6，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:162
#: c82eaf1c279441ccaf888622e29df658
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R6 外还需要 T6 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:164
#: 0102bad680b847d1ae87ade3cecb9584
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T6 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:166
#: b8bf49f3c3534154afd267a6125707c1
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:169
#: 08ed4c38659b471588a10fa22c045a35
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:171
#: 1127d048c6594669be56025858ef71fb
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART. You need to set "
"the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT (example shows "
"SERIAL2)."
msgstr ""
"支持通过任意 UART 的 Tx 引脚使用 FrSky 数传。需要设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持（示例显示 SERIAL2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:173
#: 6f1f7e5a43fc4d21b97b2caeb70e450f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:174
#: d0882492db3f46ff89abb2cf20344505
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:177
#: 9393f213ea9a4076a3477a449beaf2f9
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:179
#: fde18a619aca4094a7a2aeb6901ac905
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on "
"UART1."
msgstr ""
"KakuteH7 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。默认设置也支持在 UART1 "
"上使用 DJI Goggle OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:182
#: f1272d3888074022a37b85dbd290f9a1
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:184
#: 83365e3509664ab1a57b981a45b90b68
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. Outputs are available via two "
"JST-SH connectors. All 8 outputs support DShot and bi-directional DShot, as "
"well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"KakuteH7 最多支持 8 路 PWM 输出。输出通过两个 JST-SH 连接器引出。所有 8 路输出均支持 DShot 和双向 "
"DShot，以及所有 PWM 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:186
#: 25bcdbd6cf5c4c2e9aacbcaa92717241
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:188
#: b267efa2fecf4a2795e911b643935422
msgid "PWM 1, 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:189
#: c5bdb8176457498291bcf3ffb81aa85d
msgid "PWM 3, 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:190
#: 72512506a0bc4e6eaa0e22958659d854
msgid "PWM 5, 6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:191
#: 42fa16ada0d24d359c064881e76ae804
msgid "PWM 7, 8 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:192
#: 141436b8e3ef451e8588fb424bdcef73
msgid "PWM 9 (LED) in group5"
msgstr "PWM 9（LED）在第 5 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:194
#: 7f3947d884e44104b9e0fe925007c5f1
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道无论使用 PWM 还是 DShot 都必须使用相同的输出频率。若组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:198
#: b84e6c9e76054d668ba048a1ec9cbb66
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:200
#: 064b35fb30554935a2fc464180d27773
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:201
#: bbd017ba9e01466394ebb687ac98cf3e
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:204
#: 91a6ff4e592c4040a971eae59f42c03d
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr "LED 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:206
#: b4fd64b8d9cb4321ba510333840db5f1
msgid ""
"The LED output is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED "
"strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr "LED 输出默认配置为支持 :ref:`NeoPixel LED 灯带<common-serial-led-neopixel>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:209
#: 6a752ac2b5e943a19e656a6647e56939
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:211
#: 737199e64f4548b8a22e9d2214dc8006
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the B+ pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the CUR pin. "
"Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current monitoring"
" are set by default to the below for use with any Holybro Tekko32 F4 4in1 "
"ESC."
msgstr ""
"该板通过 B+ 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接到 CUR 引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已针对 Holybro "
"Tekko32 F4 4合1 ESC 进行预设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:213
#: 330861412c01489e9124ad549e37562b
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:215
#: b731a2d7338f4688a01dbcdcdfe159a3
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:216
#: 952d523c138345f4a0c4d2dc63b3c6bb
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:217
#: bc448867ae974f1c860d58fa63576d1b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:218
#: a1f2a95f81844331aee7833a200f6a4f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:219
#: 9ba053bf69ef47d5b4d6b5fbb8662534
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` varies "
"depending on external current sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 根据所用外部电流传感器而定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:222
#: 8098a04ed1af4d6a99cf9281ef39b8c9
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:224
#: a23064464e53449789c101801409b9b7
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 V2 does not have a built-in compass, however you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteH7 V2 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:227
#: bca21066c36742ab9647941b80e03be3
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:229
#: ebf082c72c2f436291160ae2bf64c918
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"KakuteH7v2\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标有 「KakuteH7v2」 的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:232
#: f9c6077f0c0f4ab78121e673b83711d4
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:234
#: 3df4fb29db27408a83eb557ac6987c88
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7-v2.rst:238
#: 018b9eae2330440a97836a92923a25b1
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
